<title>USA: U S West Communications Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>U S West Communications Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.68		    $0.61</p>
<p> Net			339,000		  294,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,587,000		2,465,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 481,300		  475,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 earnings include after-tax charge of $11 million, or $0.02 per share from sale of rural exchanges in Nebraska. Q1 1996 include charges to reflect changes in accounting principles, which cut EPS by $0.08 per share.</p>
<p>U S West Communications Group is part of U S West Inc.</p>
<p>First Call Q1 1997 estimate was $0.65 per share.</p>
<p>For telephone operations only, operating revenues for Q1 1997 were $2.547 billion, up 5.8 percent from $2.408 billion in Q1 1996.</p>
</text>
